/giuliano176","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/commits/3af7d7dcd0e1a8acfa9e111f792ae8d552cd1fbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:42:29Z","email":"75381134+giuliano176@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Giuliano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:42:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"CO-4322 prepare release/v0.20.x (#1405)\n\n* ci: bump jenkins-lib-common to v4.13.0\n\nEnables RC upload and production build for release/* and hotfix/*\ntag builds, which v4.10.2 skipped because the commit is not contained\nin origin/main.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 261c48d7bf2929a3c020e94c29f11824e71d74c6)\n\n* fix: rework restore account config with full restore options\n\n(cherry picked from commit 7e42e598e1e7d427eab21894b263f069cbadbdee)\n\n* style(admin-ui-privacy/app-view): set container height to fit\n\n* chore(release): add release/v0.20.x maintenance branch\n\n* test: fix grace-period and restore config-step locators\n\n- grace-period: anchor day-cell locators to the month grid with exact\n  regexes (same fix as #1396 on main) so 7 does not match 17/27\n- app-view restore tests: the config step now renders a DropDownInput\n  labeled Domain instead of a Search input (CO-4322 rework), update\n  the locators accordingly\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Marco <marco.pernigo.07@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"63e9147ce3e82ab14dc5bf4df98e990b8a7d556b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/git/trees/63e9147ce3e82ab14dc5bf4df98e990b8a7d556b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/git/commits/3af7d7dcd0e1a8acfa9e111f792ae8d552cd1fbf","verification":{"payload":"tree 63e9147ce3e82ab14dc5bf4df98e990b8a7d556b\nparent 2cbbec00761e1507653457161fffdc1346a49ca7\nauthor Giuliano <75381134+giuliano176@users.noreply.github.com> 1791290549 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791290549 +0200\n\nCO-4322 prepare release/v0.20.x (#1405)\n\n* ci: bump jenkins-lib-common to v4.13.0\n\nEnables RC upload and production build for release/* and hotfix/*\ntag builds, which v4.10.2 skipped because the commit is not contained\nin origin/main.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 261c48d7bf2929a3c020e94c29f11824e71d74c6)\n\n* fix: rework restore account config with full restore options\n\n(cherry picked from commit 7e42e598e1e7d427eab21894b263f069cbadbdee)\n\n* style(admin-ui-privacy/app-view): set container height to fit\n\n* chore(release): add release/v0.20.x maintenance branch\n\n* test: fix grace-period and restore config-step locators\n\n- grace-period: anchor day-cell locators to the month grid with exact\n  regexes (same fix as #1396 on main) so 7 does not match 17/27\n- app-view restore tests: the config step now renders a DropDownInput\n  labeled Domain instead of a Search input (CO-4322 rework), update\n  the locators accordingly\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Marco <marco.pernigo.07@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxOy1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFWAQAC/+WBVozr094Ad7aMwCQDr6\ndH/AROn9Xy4eVAqBshXmnTtKj7hAwPe6VbkYOPprfaq2fFQwOgHke7cOnEk0Tfc8\nEob0kfKlM8sRg+z6s+SaeUbBQQQVGJC+tbMcfQr5Yc4/o/z8vZtuCmC+2NYWEXsN\n+0qqLz/fO2i0wfvlnC4xLlMYxpYXNUfYzF+nS5Z3RnOXabuF2+mMyWZ3iyTFVGeb\nJYPUhAZsU4N8lipt+rer5dmwLPD8V2bVRL5XyR6xHGKPopY+pPNHXW2GDW3Xz68O\nth0gmGrkyPfZPfDJKQ0Iit70g2pEmXgYaFItfS40bIogom1o6ZEaCbbvzeyN99Qc\nAiYUcYtdspDu9HXo1FpPrHSBWrl+2SlTGxms1ekHD9N7SwUTfxlWLWXURLYVfZkJ\nI3BCySzPWQ2qFE7D3Dfj7Uq+7tzQQZiaqJfBtXTg55rMixSlIFOrRZMfICvZtgza\ntS3dOW/N0qvodBGVI2YkD2rbTspyYEhPtol9fOnaFMiUgv/ztTqmbHwAKTxOlA/9\nOmwTF71be0r2MSUqy6aUURsvTrmQkVvxG6fxk2x09w5Gh9OEKov7kDxBEYaXgHw9\nqa/DZN/EpO8l+wM7mjPkYoiULifM5kLJtPpmXRcNE8aMLDd1VEOJIfsO87cLoWcd\nkIfLBsCVMzQwjFkRBwDd\n=hFjB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T12:42:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4",