875,"login":"gjed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzAwODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/commits/ad8bfc64f82f521f09f56d27543983f5a1d48d09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T08:33:57Z","email":"marco.pernigo.07@gmail.com","name":"Marco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T09:19:41Z","email":"marco.pernigo.07@gmail.com","name":"Marco"},"message":"fix: raise sonar JS/TS analyzer node heap to 6144 MB\n\nSince PR #1380 (vitest 5 / vite 8 upgrade) every TS program built by the\nsonar JS analyzer grew by ~20-45 node_modules typings, pushing the\nlargest module (admin-ui-domains, ~2500 files in program) past the\nbridge''s default 2240 MB V8 heap. The bridge process aborts mid-analysis\n(\"WebSocket connection closed abnormally\"), failing every main build\nsince #23 and blocking releases.\n\nVerified via cluster metrics: agent pnpm container plateaus at ~3.4 GB\n(scanner JVM + bridge at its heap cap) then collapses; no cgroup OOM\nevents. Container limit is 8 GiB, so 6144 MB fits.","tree":{"sha":"682afa0cfc47df07a80561aa78aa6197fe49bf12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/git/trees/682afa0cfc47df07a80561aa78aa6197fe49bf12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/git/commits/ad8bfc64f82f521f09f56d27543983f5a1d48d09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12700875?v=4","events_url":"