atar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/giuliano176","id":75381134,"login":"giuliano176","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzgxMTM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giuliano176/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giuliano176/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giuliano176/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giuliano176/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giuliano176/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giuliano176","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui/commits/b04affc4f7f0e294401ba2f8491f51ad5801d20f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:31:27Z","email":"75381134+giuliano176@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Giuliano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:31:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"CO-4288: Upgrade to Vitest 5 + test suite performance pass (#1380)\n\n- Vitest 4.1.11 → 5.0.1 across all workspaces (all @vitest/* packages in lockstep, vitest-browser-react → 2.3.0, explicit root vite peer)\n- Adopted v5''s strict locator matching — ~100 locator fixes in 20 browser test files, plus the config/infra fixes v5 requires (ui-shared test config, ui-components MSW worker)\n- Coverage provider switched istanbul → v8 (Sonar lcov unchanged); MSW workers regenerated where stale\n- Performance pass on the slowest test files: removed redundant resets, replaced fixed sleeps with settle polls, bypassed 700ms debounces in tests that don''t cover debouncing, merged duplicate single-assertion tests (~120 tests removed, all original assertions preserved)\n- Fixed test flakiness: mta checkbox listener race, create-account request guards, hardened soapFetch against empty responses","tree":{"sha":"f6ef8fa684c0bb70364b77657b770f7d2b31849e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zextras/carbonio-admin-console-ui