es until the dispense is queryable, and row selection is scoped to the test patient to avoid collisions with prescriptions created by parallel workers.","tree":{"sha":"a7cbce66745e3461efc9901547fd08b75756ec2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-dispensing-app/git/trees/a7cbce66745e3461efc9901547fd08b75756ec2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-dispensing-app/git/commits/e217d6a9ca86109c0994b1fcb96a7b1d491f00c6","verification":{"payload":"tree a7cbce66745e3461efc9901547fd08b75756ec2d\nparent 376ff887ac160aad0a56011fdb1ae5a62014b14b\nauthor Cliff Gita <46714226+gitcliff@users.noreply.github.com> 1783022796 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783022796 +0300\n\n(test) O3-4868: Add e2e test for editing a medication dispense event (#316)\n\nAdds an e2e test verifying that a medication dispense record can be edited from the History and comments panel, covering expanding the test patient''s prescription row, editing the dispensed quantity, and confirming the updated quantity in the UI.\n\nAdds a worker-scoped fhirApi Playwright fixture bound to the FHIR R4 API, plus commands for creating and deleting a MedicationDispense. The setup hook polls the FHIR search the prescription details view issues until the dispense is queryable, and row selection is scoped to the test patient to avoid collisions with prescriptions created by parallel workers.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRsTMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/50QACY23+ZzPiqhrHShEm2oEXpQ\nNc7XK84/Sm58u3n1D0wXwnxuE6StXO408abRhNRGkkeVKq/GMOPhnN2l4QNA1pvk\nQZ8ZOzzKIBpMlF3xQM4HM5eBVniStK/GhD6tVGEVhaJWQ7ghOMx5io2/8P64LY7Y\n83JBXzTX1id1VqUtlFrI1ep50f8OS741bU2T+7j5ODACRr+GhVK2f97khkQSk7YG\nPh4N8St2Ln3PJivxVKBw8VC/G4BYmlx9dnveFLfe8WqS51qVq/KSJJNp1nqQegBX\npGsnaoS0aT55ZvV/kzd36Zmx55VmfTLeyQz6VambdyFOVCZ/tPwHSn0cG2Omrtl/\nGRMMxazojRiV6qvtV7jL037fH9oIfdYZ044mmULpcgxO5TiRyEWiMK/EtqKq5iXf\nlSqJ4oYY7eE/dcZn+BaIydOTmwhD+524XCRj5+QZY+TElLvBJEyFHfIG5XnoURJ5