":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/3cc2d80205b1535d2c81691b7a9450a66c7f88ee","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKDNjYzJkODAyMDViMTUzNWQyYzgxNjkxYjdhOTQ1MGE2NmM3Zjg4ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746","sha":"290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746"}],"sha":"3cc2d80205b1535d2c81691b7a9450a66c7f88ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/3cc2d80205b1535d2c81691b7a9450a66c7f88ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:31:50Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:31:50Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"docs(skills): `rig wiki install-skill --project` writes real files, not symlinks\n\nA symlink at `<project>/.claude/skills/rig-wiki/SKILL.md` pointing into\n`/usr/local/lib/node_modules/rigjs/...` (or wherever rigjs happens to be\ninstalled) is machine-specific and breaks the moment anyone else clones\nthe repo or runs it on CI / a different install prefix. For a project\nthat wants its agent behaviour committed and reproducible, the right\noutput is a real file copy.\n\n- `installSkill.ts`: `--project` mode now copies the canonical file\n  content into both `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and\n  `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Idempotent: same-content existing\n  copy is a no-op; different content needs `--force`. The default global\n  mode (writing to `~/.claude/skills/`) stays as a symlink — that dir is\n  not committed, so the link''s auto-follow behaviour is a feature.\n- `skills.md`: rewritten to reflect the copy semantics. The \"Special\n  case — rig in a sibling submodule\" section preserves the in-tree\n  symlink pattern (overmind''s actual setup) as an explicit opt-out, not\n  the default. Reasoning spelled out: install-path variance breaks\n  committed symlinks across machines.\n\nNo version bump — docs + install-skill behaviour shift only. Owner will\nchoose the next release tag.","tree":{"sha":"1c69d9408c1f50699c2995aad8e94658819c354c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/1c69d9408c1f50699c2995aad8e94658819c354c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKDI5MDcyOGU3OGIzODk4MjEyMjIxNTdlMDkyZmU1N2I5ZDY5YzY3NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620","sha":"d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620"}],"sha":"290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/290728e78b389821222157e092fe57b9d69c6746"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:23:56Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:23:56Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"nm","tree":{"sha":"393706d2f6d38ed0b0f6b99bf7e7d98718da99d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/393706d2f6d38ed0b0f6b99bf7e7d98718da99d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKGQ2YTAyYzYzZmFkZjczMDdhYTBmYzUwMzA2YWZkMTg3YTNjN2E2MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a","sha":"939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a"}],"sha":"d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/d6a02c63fadf7307aa0fc50306afd187a3c7a620"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:20:19Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:20:19Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"feat(wiki): schema-driven `rig wiki survey` + drop glob defaults\n\nReplace per-vault `include`/`exclude` glob config as the default\ngatekeeper. Filtering is now a 3-layer pipeline:\n\n  1. Walk-time hard floor — hidden segments + .gitignored + a built-in\n     BINARY_EXTENSIONS list (archives / binaries / AV / design /\n     model-weights / lockfiles). See `lib/wiki/fileTypes.ts`.\n  2. Schema-driven policy — every vault''s `schema.md` now ships with an\n     `## Ingestion policy` section that describes in natural language\n     what this wiki wants. Default body covers the obvious rules and\n     leaves a \"Custom rules (edit me)\" subsection.\n  3. Agent triage — new `rig wiki survey` command walks the scan root,\n     drops walk-time-excluded files, extracts the policy section, and\n     asks the configured agent (Claude) to classify the rest as\n     ingest/skip/unclear with a one-line reason. Batched in a single\n     prompt for speed.\n\n`rig wiki survey` flags:\n  -a, --apply        chain `rig wiki ingest` for each \"ingest\" decision\n  -l, --limit <n>    cap candidates passed to the agent (default 500)\n  --no-agent         skip the LLM — accept every non-binary candidate\n  --json             machine output\n\nOther tweaks:\n- `composeEntry` default `include` flips from `[''**/*.md'']` to `[''**/*'']`\n  (the binary extension list does the real cutting now).\n- `scan` walker honors `isBinaryExtension()`.\n- `init` schema.md template grows the `## Ingestion policy` section.\n- Skill `RIG_WIKI_SKILL.md` intent table adds three rows: survey,\n  survey --apply, and \"what''s the policy?\" (read schema.md, don''t write it).\n- Version bump 4.0.9 → 4.0.10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0005fc558cdd46125b7e46aa26a0d166b31e8450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/0005fc558cdd46125b7e46aa26a0d166b31e8450"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKDkzOWM5MDFkODAzOGFjY2Q2MjY0MTgzZGNhNDY3ODBiYmYzMTk4NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/695b16497eac703c67845bf48a59ca791086a667","sha":"695b16497eac703c67845bf48a59ca791086a667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/695b16497eac703c67845bf48a59ca791086a667"}],"sha":"939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/939c901d8038accd6264183dca46780bbf31985a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/695b16497eac703c67845bf48a59ca791086a667/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:10:39Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:10:39Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"fix(wiki): close the source_sha loop so scan detects MODIFIED + ingest re-targets the same slug\n\nThe MODIFIED detection in `scan` was reading from `state.db.source_sha` but\nnothing in the codebase ever wrote to it — the table stayed empty forever,\nso every scan reported everything as NEW, RAW DRIFT was dead code, and a\nsecond `ingest` of the same source produced ghost siblings instead of\noverwriting the existing page.\n\nChanges:\n\n- `db.ts`: new helpers `upsertSourceSha` (single), `upsertSourceShasBulk`\n  (transactional bulk for `scan --baseline`), `deleteSourceSha`.\n- `ingest.ts`: after a successful real ingest (not --dry-run), upsert the\n  source''s current sha + mtime keyed by root-relative path (same key\n  `scan` uses for lookups). Failures are non-fatal warnings.\n- `ingest.ts` prompt: explicit rule that re-ingesting the same source MUST\n  update `sources/<slug>.md` in place, never create `-2.md` siblings.\n  Preserve original `ingested-at`, refresh `last-updated` and `source-sha`.\n- `scan.ts`: new `--baseline` (`-b`) flag — walks include[] as usual and\n  bulk-upserts current shas into state.db without touching wiki content.\n  Useful for \"I already have N files, just stop reporting them as NEW.\"\n- Version: 4.0.8 → 4.0.9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"117fae5b064b388927bcc98070fc9f0734eca68b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/117fae5b064b388927bcc98070fc9f0734eca68b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/695b16497eac703c67845bf48a59ca791086a667","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur