gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/dd26f7bc0c4d7b8cf5eab6de01d8d4c40bca7376/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:29:49Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:29:49Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"docs(wiki-skill): mark rig wiki as agent-only orchestration\n\nMake it explicit that rig wiki is driven BY a coding agent (Claude\nCode, Codex, …), not invoked directly by humans on the command line.\nThe CLI is the agent''s tool; users state intent in natural language.\n\n- frontmatter description leads with \"Agent-only orchestration skill\"\n  and reaffirms that humans don''t memorise CLI flags\n- new \"Positioning\" paragraph at the top: agent runs, observes, reports;\n  raw CLI use is a fallback, not the default\n- output-handling section rewritten — agent should summarise in natural\n  language, not dump rig output verbatim; offer follow-ups like \"want me\n  to ingest the new ones?\"\n- setup flow tightened — single suggested subdir, pause-and-ask the user\n  to edit purpose.md (the one and only human anchor), no other prompts","tree":{"sha":"1802d777046f22c5a9bf1039bd84ce4e4e838721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/1802d777046f22c5a9bf1039bd84ce4e4e838721"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/dd26f7bc0c4d7b8cf5eab6de01d8d4c40bca7376","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/dd26f7bc0c4d7b8cf5eab6de01d8d4c40bca7376","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKGRkMjZmN2JjMGM0ZDdiOGNmNWVhYjZkZTAxZDhkNGM0MGJjYTczNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07","sha":"c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07"}],"sha":"dd26f7bc0c4d7b8cf5eab6de01d8d4c40bca7376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/dd26f7bc0c4d7b8cf5eab6de01d8d4c40bca7376"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:21:02Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:21:02Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"feat(wiki): refuse hidden + gitignored sources at init/ingest/scan\n\nProject policy: rig wiki must not absorb content the project has\ndeliberately hidden or ignored. Enforce at three places:\n\n- `lib/wiki/pathGuard.ts` (new): `guardPath()` rejects any path whose\n  segments start with `.` OR is matched by `git check-ignore` inside the\n  project repo. `refusalMessage()` prints a uniform error with the\n  workaround hint (copy to a visible, tracked location first).\n- `init.ts`: target path passes through `guardPath` before any mkdir.\n- `ingest.ts`: source path passes through `guardPath` before snapshot.\n- `scan.ts`: walker skips dot-prefixed segments at descent time\n  (avoids descending into .git/, .obsidian/, .vscode/, …). Batches a\n  single `git check-ignore --stdin -z` over the discovered candidates\n  to mark .gitignored files; both filters are applied before sha\n  comparison.\n\nSkill (RIG_WIKI_SKILL.md) gains a hard rule under \"Hard rules\":\nrefuse hidden / gitignored sources, point users at the `cp -R …` work-\naround.\n\nVerified:\n  rig wiki init tmp/.hidden-wiki        → refused (hidden)\n  rig wiki init tmp/refused-wiki        → refused (gitignored, tmp/ in .gitignore)\n  rig wiki init research/test-guards    → succeeded\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7699b5ed7fac089c69590291dfe652ef9118819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/e7699b5ed7fac089c69590291dfe652ef9118819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKGMzYTU2MDU0NmU1MDVkYjg3ZmNlODUwODA4YmZhOWMzNmM5ZWRlMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197","sha":"882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197"}],"sha":"c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/c3a560546e505db87fce850808bfa9c36c9ede07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:18:03Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:18:03Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"docs(wiki-skill): rewrite as agent operator playbook (intent → command)\n\nThe skill is loaded by Claude Code at session start to teach the AGENT\nhow to drive `rig wiki *` on the user''s behalf. The user speaks in\nintent; the agent picks the command.\n\n- frontmatter description tightened, with explicit trigger phrases in\n  CN + EN so the invocation router fires reliably\n- **intent → command** table for natural-language asks\n- argument inference rules (slug naming, raw filename, URL → slug)\n- hard rules (raw/purpose/schema untouchable; raw drift = surface; lint\n  severe = surface; caches off-limits)\n- common error → recovery table\n- \"when NOT to use\" guards against code search / unrelated systems\n- minimal architecture footer (read once, stop caring)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05b82895160662db7aad6a0df20dd59fbd869bbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/05b82895160662db7aad6a0df20dd59fbd869bbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKDg4MmZhMWFhN2IzYmU1YmQ4YjM1NWI0NmM1ZmUwNGZkODIwY2UxOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f","sha":"672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f"}],"sha":"882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/882fa1aa7b3be5bd8b355b46c5fe04fd820ce197"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:11:49Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:11:49Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"feat(wiki): init requires a subdir + document incremental ingest flow\n\n- `rig wiki init` now refuses to default to CWD. Commander enforces the\n  `<path>` positional; init.ts has a belt-and-braces guard with a hint.\n  Prevents accidentally littering a project root with wiki templates.\n\n- Skill (RIG_WIKI_SKILL.md) gains explicit \"Quickstart — incremental\n  updates\" section covering the four daily flows:\n    A. new raw source         → fetch | cp → ingest\n    B. existing/living-doc    → scan → ingest <path>\n    C. query                  → query [--synth]\n    D. maintenance            → lint | rebuild\n  Emphasis: `ingest` is the single mutating command in routine use, and\n  it triggers an incremental qmd embed automatically. Manual `index`\n  almost never needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6831ba8dc283ec81e7f76c80d4b3af5ad368bf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/f6831ba8dc283ec81e7f76c80d4b3af5ad368bf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKDY3MjI3NmQ4YmFmNzk4ZGE3NDNkMjgyZDYyMjhlNTIwMTExN2Q5M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7","sha":"d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7"}],"sha":"672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/672276d8baf798da743d282d6228e5201117d93f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:02:53Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T17:02:53Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"feat(wiki): vector-only retrieval — Qwen3 embed + Qwen3 reranker, CDN-mirrored\n\nPivot rig wiki to pure semantic retrieval. Drop BM25 (searchLex) and the\nhybrid query path that depended on the 1.2GB qmd-query-expansion model.\nCross-lingual Chinese/English works out of the box via the multilingual\nQwen3 model family.\n\nPipeline:\n  rig wiki query <q>\n    → searchVector (Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B) → top-40 candidates\n    → store.internal.rerank (Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B) on chunk bodies\n    → top-k by rerank score\n\nBoth models are CDN-mirrored on assets.terncloud.com (Aliyun globally\naccelerated, ~60MB/s in CN, decent worldwide):\n  - QMD_EMBED_MODEL  default = ...Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B-Q8_0.gguf  (~610MB)\n  - QMD_RERANK_MODEL default = ...qwen3-reranker-0.6b-q8_0.gguf   (~610MB)\n\nqmd''s `isQwen3EmbeddingModel` matches the embed URL pattern, so the Qwen3\nquery-instruction template (Instruct:/Query:) is applied automatically.\n\nVerified end-to-end on a 3-page mixed CN/EN test wiki:\n  - \"what is a reranker\" → reranker.md (rerank 0.7310 vs others 0.50)\n  - \"向量数据库 嵌入式\"  → sqlite-vec.md (rerank 0.7309)\n  - \"is there a SQLite extension for vectors\" → sqlite-vec.md (0.7310)\n  - \"如何精排候选\" (CN query, EN target) → reranker.md (0.7309)\n  Cross-lingual works. Reranker creates clean 0.73 vs 0.50 separation.\n\nCLI surface simplification:\n  rig wiki query <q>   --limit N  --no-rerank  --synth  --json\n  rig wiki index       --force                # always embed (was: --no-embed)\n  rig wiki rebuild     --skip-embed           # (drop --no-embed)\n\nDrops: --vector, --hybrid, --rerank, --no-embed flags (no longer needed —\nvector is now the only retrieval path, rerank is on by default).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a4eee6036320bb611f932055904def1e06d048d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/0a4eee6036320bb611f932055904def1e06d048d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKGQ2YmFjNDYwZGZiOWVjOWIzMTI5Yzc4NGYyM2RlNjA3NGJhMGVjZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4","sha":"8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4"}],"sha":"d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/d6bac460dfb9ec9b3129c784f23de6074ba0ece7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:45:23Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T15:45:23Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"feat(wiki): implement fetch / ingest / query / lint + CDN model default\n\n- qmd.ts: default QMD_EMBED_MODEL to the rig CDN\n  (https://assets.terncloud.com/rig/models/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B-Q8_0.gguf,\n  globally accelerated). node-llama-cpp''s resolveModelFile takes https://\n  natively. qmd''s isQwen3EmbeddingModel matches the URL → Instruct/Query\n  prompt template is auto-applied for queries.\n- query.ts: 3 modes — lex (BM25, default; instant), vector (semantic;\n  reuses embed model), hybrid (full BM25+vec+rerank; opt-in because it\n  triggers a one-time ~1GB query-expansion-model download from HF).\n  Optional --synth invokes the Claude adapter to write a paragraph\n  answer with [[wikilink]] citations.\n- lint.ts: walks wiki/**/*.md, parses frontmatter (tiny YAML reader),\n  checks required keys + sources[] resolves to a real raw/ file +\n  source-sha drift + broken [[wikilinks]] + orphan pages + reviews\n  backlog. Writes lint-report-YYYY-MM-DD.md, exit 11 on severe findings.\n- fetch.ts: HTTP fetch URL → raw/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md with frontmatter\n  (source-url, fetched-at, fetcher, content-type, content-sha).\n  Lightweight HTML→text by default; --via-agent uses Claude WebFetch for\n  better conversion.\n- ingest.ts: snapshot writable surface → invoke Claude with a two-step\n  CoT prompt (analysis → generation) inside the wiki dir with Write/Edit\n  allowed → diff snapshot vs after → reject any edit to raw/, purpose,\n  schema → append log entry → trigger incremental qmd embed. --dry-run\n  prints the diff and reverts.\n\nSmoke tests on a 2-md-file wiki:\n  - rig wiki index: 9s model download from CDN + ~13s embed = 22s total\n  - rig wiki query \"嵌入模型\": <0.3s, correct hit (score 0.59)\n  - rig wiki query \"language models\" --vector: 14s (model warm-up), 9\n    hits with the embedding-models concept at the top of the relevant\n    bucket\n  - rig wiki lint: detected broken wikilink + orphan + wrote\n    lint-report-2026-05-23.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"327a74a2a389506fcfd5d9c1996100a94100f5da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/327a74a2a389506fcfd5d9c1996100a94100f5da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4","node_id":"C_kwDOHAYJG9oAKDhlMGI1NmNjNjZlMjc1NjkzODYyNjNlMTgzMGIxNTExZjU3YmYwYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand/rig/commit/a757d06d4db4f22be500c0843058dd29053fc643","sha":"a757d06d4db4f22be500c0843058dd29053fc643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/a757d06d4db4f22be500c0843058dd29053fc643"}],"sha":"8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/8e0b56cc66e27569386263e1830b1511f57bf0a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"login":"FlashHand","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzIzOTQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/commits/a757d06d4db4f22be500c0843058dd29053fc643/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:49:55Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T13:49:55Z","email":"ralwayne@163.com","name":"ral"},"message":"feat(wiki): bundle qmd SDK + rig install-local + 4.0.1\n\n- bump version 4.0.0 → 4.0.1 + introduce versionCode 26052301 (format\n  YYMMDDNN, bumper at scripts/version-code.mjs — same algorithm as\n  bitterless/scripts/publish.js)\n- new `rig -c` flag prints versionCode\n- new `rig install-local` command: yarn build + in-place rsync to\n  <npm-prefix>/lib/node_modules/rigjs (files[] + node_modules), force\n  +x on launcher, auto re-link Claude skill. Avoids EACCES on\n  root-owned npm prefixes; later `npm i -g rigjs` overrides cleanly.\n- @tobilu/qmd ~2.5.2 added as a hard dependency; lib/wiki/qmd.ts\n  rewritten to dynamic-import the ESM SDK (createStore / update /\n  embed / search / close) with per-wiki dbPath at\n  ~/.rig/cache/qmd/<wiki>.sqlite. detectQmd reports bundled version\n  via a node_modules walk (qmd''s `exports` field blocks require).\n- new `rig wiki rebuild`: wipe per-wiki sqlite store + source_sha\n  rows, then full re-embed. Use on new device or after switching\n  embed model.\n- `rig wiki init` now emits a .gitignore covering .qmd/index.sqlite*,\n  lint-report-*.md, proposals/ — so vector caches never enter git.\n- RIG_WIKI_SKILL.md rewritten: qmd on-disk model, sync rules\n  (never commit the vector store), Obsidian vault compatibility,\n  new-device 5-step flow, internal qmd integration note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c92f28f0a7bfbbc92174788ed94bc5b6f3ef21b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/trees/c92f28f0a7bfbbc92174788ed94bc5b6f3ef21b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlashHand/rig/git/commits/a757d06d4db4f22be500c0843058dd29053fc643","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11323941?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FlashHand/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FlashHand","id":11323941,"log