ugin/.template/.user as row roots instead of .tag\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Narrow PR: .tag on tag rows, theme-author STRUCTURE.md, focused structure e2e\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Delete e2e/structure.spec.ts\n\n* Use .ext.upload instead of .tag.upload for upload row styling\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Drop .tag from entity rows everywhere; .tag is only for inline tag links\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update class name usage and remove example snippets\n\nClarified usage of class names for user rows and tags. Removed example theme snippets for brevity.\n\n* Add reusable CSS class reference to STRUCTURE.md\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Document CSS variables and pre-fill new custom themes\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Document Ref viewer embeds in STRUCTURE.md skeleton\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Flatten entity rows onto an iOS 13 compatible CSS grid\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Use min-content auto rows on ref grid; keep comment reply shrink-to-fit\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Select owning .ref directly in E2E row locators\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update known quirks section in STRUCTURE.md\n\nClarify known quirks related to refs and plugin views.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Localize the generated custom theme template\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Use a single Ref viewer and move it below the row with CSS order\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Render below viewer after row controls so DOM order matches visual order\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix e2e: use #mod-masonry checkbox for plugin/image after Masonry merge\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Mobile: put ref info and actions in the same grid cell\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Mobile: delay ref info/actions padding change until collapse finishes\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Chris Malloy <cjmalloy@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"042c5d03198d636f93b219b452cce5ea394cc98b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjmalloy/jasper-ui/git/trees/042c5d03198d636f93b219b452cce5ea394cc98b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjmalloy/jasper-ui/git/commits/05986b2c90e81b758e74a4d1e1f20463c9a7f19d","verification":{"payload":"tree 042c5d03198d636f93b219b452cce5ea394cc98b\nparent d0a4b91178e420c1372297ece2bc5d8c2168307b\nauthor Copilot <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1791161833 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791161833 -0300\n\nStandardize CSS structure (#1497)\n\n* Standardize ref/tag row structure, add STRUCTURE.md and structure e2e spec\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Delete e2e/structure.spec.ts\n\n* Clarify `.fake-link` description in STRUCTURE.md\n\nUpdated the description of `.fake-link` to clarify it can be a link-styled `&lt;a&gt;` or `&lt;span&gt;` that runs code instead of navigating.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove unused e2e/selectors.ts and struc