EyMmU1MDgxOTNlM2ZhMmNiYjlhOGE4MTNkMzViYmQzZTFkZWFhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjmalloy/jasper-ui/commit/b1b6d9804eb86685a423cdff837a3ff958f45739","sha":"b1b6d9804eb86685a423cdff837a3ff958f45739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjmalloy/jasper-ui/commits/b1b6d9804eb86685a423cdff837a3ff958f45739"}],"sha":"122e508193e3fa2cbb9a8a813d35bbd3e1deaa57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjmalloy/jasper-ui/commits/122e508193e3fa2cbb9a8a813d35bbd3e1deaa57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjmalloy/jasper-ui/commits/b1b6d9804eb86685a423cdff837a3ff958f45739/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:35:39Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Copilot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:35:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Map picker for location input, live geo preview, and plugin/map embed (#1472)\n\n* Add map picker to location input and plugin/map embed\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix location map layout, plugin/map mod grouping, add e2e test\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Share one location map per plugin, fix input widths and list drag\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor MultiLineString handling to GeometryCollection\n\nRefactor MultiLineString case to return a GeometryCollection with appropriate geometries.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor geometry handling in contextData method\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Follow RFC 7946 linear rings: never auto-close polygons, render consistently\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Enhance polygon function for geometry handling\n\nRefactor polygon function to handle holes and ensure proper closure of rings.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Auto close polygon rings in the editor, render rings per RFC 7946\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Seed new location points from neighbours and skip unset points in preview\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add multi-provider geocoding search and reverse geocoded title scraping\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor mapData processing to include geoFeatures\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Use visible size for list keyboard boundary checks\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Move geocoder search into a MapLibre control on both maps\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add aria-live attribute to geocoder results\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Use declarative mgl-control with a GeocoderComponent instead of map.addControl\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Keep geocoder results region rendered so aria-live announces updates\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Replace custom geocoder with @maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder control\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add showResultsWhileTyping option to geocoder\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Skip markers for unset [0, 0] geo points\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Keep geocoder control layout from being overridden by global input/button styles\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Provide MapLibre worker URL via provideMaplibreWorker and fix geocoder.ts syntax\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Configurable geocoder position, zoom controls bottom left, and search result markers\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refine location validation in hasLocation function\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Improve location marker accessibility features\n\nEnhance accessibility for location marker with ARIA attributes and keyboard support.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Improve marker element accessibility and interaction\n\nEnhance marker element with accessibility features and event handling.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Map click drops a reverse geocoded submit marker; ref markers show titles\n\nCo-authored-by: cjmalloy <1704049+cjmalloy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n